Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:35:18 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/30] WIP mmb: IQ3_S routed experts (WTYPE 5, on-the-fly
 grid/sign dequant)

- mmb_dq_row_iq3s: 64-value quarter of a 110-byte IQ3_S super-block, loaded
  from the row base in store_lds (fields are non-contiguous)
- WTYPE 5 in tile_gemm/tile_gemm_glu/routed/glu/dense + dispatch + predicates
- IQ4_XS: pp2048 723->838 (+16%), pp8192 685->779 (+14%);
  PPL 10.6938 -> 10.6440 (parity)
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/mmb.cu | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 61 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

